<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tomato-potato-mix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4075168); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4075168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607569895" alt="TOMATO-POTATO-MIX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4075168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tomato-potato-mix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4075168); return false;">TOMATO-POTATO-MIX</a></span></p>
